gyb/* linguist-vendored

# Data files are LF on every machine. `*.csv` does not match `*.csv2`, which is
# the format this project actually writes, so both globs are needed.
# 資料檔在每一台機器上都用 LF。`*.csv` 匹配不到 `*.csv2`，而後者才是本專案實際寫出的格式，故兩者都要。
*.csv text eol=lf
*.csv2 text eol=lf

# Append-only logs merge by union, so two machines appending never conflict.
# NOT the two matrix files -- their rows are rewritten in place, and union keeps
# BOTH versions of an edited row without conflicting, which is worse than a
# conflict.
# 純附加的紀錄檔以 union 合併，使兩台機器各自附加時不會衝突。**不含**兩個矩陣檔——它們的列會被就地
# 重寫，而 union 對就地編輯不會衝突、會把該列的兩個版本都留下，那比衝突更糟。
matrix_coverage/results.csv2 merge=union
mistakes/mistakes.csv2 merge=union
buildtime/buildtime.csv2 merge=union

