# be a set, which files are deliberately excluded, and three wrong scopes with
# what refuted each -- is in .gitattributes.md.
#
# It lives there because it does not belong here. Both machines wrote long
# bilingual justifications into THIS file in the same round, and the result
# conflicted on four consecutive exchanges while the rules themselves never
# disagreed: both sides independently reached the same three union lines. The
# file was 277 lines, 265 of them comment, for five rules.
#
# 上述一切的證據——union 為何在此安全、為何不可以是集合、哪些檔案被刻意排除，以及三個錯誤的範圍
# 各自被什麼推翻——都在 .gitattributes.md。
#
# 它放在那裡，是因為它本來就不屬於這裡。兩台機器在同一輪中各自把長篇雙語論證寫進**本檔**，結果是連續
# 四次交換都衝突，而規則本身從未有分歧：雙方獨立地得出了完全相同的三行 union。當時本檔共 277 行，
